ge","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"近所の輸入品専門店で買いました","ts":"1627975533.147500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eQX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ba23a93-7179-4cc5-a586-e1f8e2501d06","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://ahmadtea.jp/products/228/\u003e\nノンシュガーな水出し紅茶を探してたどり着いたのがこちら。\n気をつけないとジュースばっかり飲んじゃうので、こういうのを飲むようにしてます。","ts":"1627975397.147000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OfB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9df4cb7f-de5e-45ee-a872-8780716ddd8e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"リコピンが肝臓にいいって話を聞いて続けるようになったのですが、まあ多少は疲れにくくなったかなという感じですね。","ts":"1627972162.145900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DY1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e186430f-59ba-4834-998f-31ef0878f17c","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"デルモンテの昔からあるトマジューは好き。塩入ってるけど。","ts":"1627971906.144500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VcU8z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"773d4001-ff65-4e51-a6ca-c3b8b63dc50f","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"トマジュー大好き\nタバスコをほんの少し垂らしても美味しい","ts":"1627971451.144000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H1sk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff20d367-2665-44e9-ba1d-2ba3bcfa9825","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"トマトは好きだがトマトジュースは苦手","ts":"1627971380.143400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pOii"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b544896-52dc-4e4b-b673-8dafa33a930b","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"自分が飲んでるのは濃縮還元のみのタイプですね。食塩無添加ってものです。","ts":"1627971345.142800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YzR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40477b7e-36fc-4918-9733-fb5eeb38250d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"えぐみとみるか風味ととるかは人によるでしょうしね..","ts":"1627971344.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U/6Ev"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6eae4e3a-fe8b-49c8-844f-08992562ec7d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"無糖のものもありますが....","ts":"1627971330.142200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RTG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30d02a15-db00-42dc-9bd2-2918d77a5c8d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あの口に残る独特のエグみがダメなんすよ…健康のためにと思って飲んでますが。","ts":"1627971253.141100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OxSnB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4422e60f-d9b2-4a38-920a-03db83910d47","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"トマトジュースには砂糖結構入ってそう","ts":"1627971246.140900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w+0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"686c3c19-a5ee-4a7f-8ca7-dac9a7cd44d7","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"個人的にトマトジュースを毎日飲むのがいいと思っています。:tomato:マジで大嫌いなんですが。","ts":"1627971134.140200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QgznX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feee5862-4639-493c-810a-56ee799c1809","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"日記じゃないけどブログ書いてるので様子がおかしかったら通報おねがいしますｗ","ts":"1627960415.138600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U017BU3UZBQ","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"rolling_on_the_floor_laughing","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Ha"}]},{"client_msg_id":"807512ac-a442-496a-9967-b52b6a26f43b","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"大丈夫ですか、いさなさん。気付かないうちに腕食べてないですか? 日記ちゃんと書いてますか?","ts":"1627960308.137700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U011FTGJ3SN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kiw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fbddfa3-b696-4c39-816e-ea2b2ebfaa27","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それはもしかして、かゆうまでは……","ts":"1627960253.136800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c4kxP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de100e10-09c4-499e-9b60-f5ab1a60814c","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"副反応と言えば、モデルナ一回目打って二週間経ったら打ったところに痒みを感じるようになってきました","ts":"1627960213.136500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/IF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"369d5cb8-6271-4519-9ffa-b7a1a2645838","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"というわけで、ダイエットとか生活環境が前と変化しているときに、体調不良の原因を特定するのは容易ではないという話ですね","ts":"1627960131.135300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iCM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58f79c62-df41-4510-8612-efd80e67ba90","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"はー、なるほど。とはいえパラメタ増えてトラブりやすくなるのもあるだろうなあ","ts":"1627960068.134500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FUX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1e320b5-913e-4e08-8e62-31901d780e54","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u0026gt; 人体、調整するパラメータ多すぎ問題\nそいえば、予防接種後に、運動や酒などを控えるのは、それらが身体に悪いという話ではなく、変数を減らして副反応との関係を確認しやすくするためらしいですね。","ts":"1627959979.133200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZeBZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d07b6c8-79f9-41aa-b98d-0c20d612892d","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"飯と水と睡眠くらいしか気を使ってない。","ts":"1627957318.131400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1kVp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1447E5F0-7794-4ED2-9E53-7466CA48A855","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"だるいときよりは疲れたとき向けかもしれない\n酸味と糖分で頭に喝を入れる感じ","ts":"1627957244.130700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"795"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26377733-F73A-457E-8FA9-D8C231B95B51","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"これも気休めかもですが、蜂蜜に漬けた輪切りレモンをつまんだりなんかもよくやってます\n作るのも簡単だし、冷凍保存も効くしでおすすめ","ts":"1627957187.129300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V/iZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cd30fc3-a382-4e80-9626-4d43862a2498","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あと在宅勤務で外にあまり出てないなら朝、日光を浴びてみるとかですかね？","ts":"1627957006.126500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Mb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb37213b-9814-4897-bdf8-4a6725735b1a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"サバイバルゲームみたいにメシと水と体温くらいだけにしてほしい","ts":"1627956945.125900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8VC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64bfe211-04d1-45c2-893c-2f4b7a3f31af","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"人体、調整するパラメータ多すぎ問題","ts":"1627956867.125400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":5,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U022XK5866Q","U81LLJ340","UL6CFN8NR","U023H98P3N0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XmVT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1D041F14-8740-4EFF-8ABE-285B805FBA7C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でも、ゴリラさんの場合は、体重が落ちたせいもあるのでは？","ts":"1627956859.125200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1OfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"174C0AB4-BDC6-47B7-8497-5332C6C7DDD2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"体がだるいと思っていたら、実は血糖値足りてなくて脳がだるいだけだったってのもあるかも。","ts":"1627956797.124200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yj8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71d36f51-bfc0-45e4-814f-2e8d3ef9fa29","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"いっぱい寝るとそれはそれでだるくなるので注意です。","ts":"1627956635.123200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UGJG6S9JM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nwA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23c17f49-f438-4843-8320-6f76b9a89997","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょっと今日はいっぱい寝てみるか…","ts":"1627956518.122700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/r3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09E15854-FFAF-4954-9BFD-FEAED1589D86","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":":syringe: fully vaccinated :syringe: ","ts":"1627955567.121700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vaccine","count":4,"users":["U81LLJ340","UCL78DG68","U017BU3UZBQ","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31513001-2cc6-492a-b20b-c94767426220","type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"カフェイン減らして、程よく運動した後に寝る\n3日くらい集中して睡眠時間を確保すると大体良くなる気がします","ts":"1627954307.121100","edited":{"user":"U023H98P3N0","ts":"1627954344.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fWo+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31fe5c3e-baeb-469e-9a28-774e0353db57","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"日中なら軽く運動、夜ならストレッチして寝る","ts":"1627953550.120500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d7Ea"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0E2E0A3C-AD90-4EA4-8C22-5EC722A83ABB","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"整体に行く","ts":"1627953458.120100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brYl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"260f2057-63ff-4b80-96ea-ffdb9bad88b4","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"あと寝る","ts"